# Sustainable Fashion Practices Recommendations<br>
<br>
## Introduction<br>
<br>
As part of our ongoing efforts to integrate sustainable practices into the TemporaryAI project, we propose revising our research plan to include more detailed information on reducing waste and promoting environmentally friendly production methods.<br>
<br>
## Revised Research Plan<br>
<br>
1. Conduct a thorough analysis of current waste management strategies in the fashion industry.<br>
2. Identify opportunities for implementing circular economy principles in the design process.<br>
3. Develop guidelines for sustainable material sourcing and supply chain management.<br>
4. Establish metrics for measuring the environmental impact of TemporaryAI&#x27;s fashion products.<br>
